---
name: tessera-formal-review
description: Review a Tessera formal model or capstone-ledger claim with bounded conclusions, producer/consumer evidence, and direct artifact checks.
argument-hint: "[artifact or review question]"
user-invocable: false
allowed-tools: Read, Grep, Glob, Bash
