   123	|---|---|---|---|
   124	| dispatch out | `UNVERIFIABLE` / `OUT_OF_PROFILE` | rows 1.1–1.4 `OUT_OF_PROFILE` | L-01, L-01b–d, L-02, L-03, L-03b, L-04, L-04b, L-05, L-06 (11) |
   125	| alg `unsupported`, no defect, no missing evidence | `UNVERIFIABLE` / `ALG_UNKNOWN` | row 7.1 `ALG_UNKNOWN` | ALG-01, L-21, HY-a1/a2/a3-C, HY-ak-C, HY-b1-H, HY-d1/d2-C, HY-d1/d2-H (11); HY-b2-H is the unknown alg with a non-verifying opaque signature |
   126	| unknown alg + absent signature | `INVALID` | row 3.1 `SIG_EMPTY` / `LENGTH_CAP` | ALG-02, ALG-03, HY-a4-C |
   127	| alg `substituted` | `INVALID` | row 6.3 `RECEIPT_MANIFEST_MISMATCH` | ALG-04, ALG-05 |
   128	| alg `missing` / `malformed` / `encoding_mismatch` | `INVALID` | codec rows 3.1 / 4.1 (ENC order) | codec and HY-N4 cases |
   129	| alg `prohibited` | `INVALID` | none: V1's `alg_prohibited` is `[]` | none (unreachable in V1) |
   130	| alg supported, signature bad | `INVALID` | row 9.2 `SIG_INVALID` | F10-f, HY-N2, HY-N6 |
   131	| unknown alg + independent failure (**mixed**) | `INVALID` / `FAILED` | the failed row's code | L-107 (`BUNDLE_OBJECT_HASH`) |
   132	| evidence absent, no defect | `UNVERIFIABLE` / `MEMBER_MISSING` | row 2.2 `MEMBER_MISSING:<path>` | L-09 (case d2), L-10, F03-e, F03-j |
   133	| evidence absent + unknown alg, no defect | `UNVERIFIABLE` / `MEMBER_MISSING` | row 2.2 before row 7.1 | AGG-d |
   134	| defect + evidence absent (**d3**) | `INVALID` | the failed row's code | A-d3 (`DNS_KEY_MISMATCH`) |
   135	| all present and good, strict | `VALID_STRICT` / `OK` | `OK` | A-a |
